# Walkthrough - Aceternity Auth Integration

I have successfully replaced the previous forms with the professional "Aceternity UI" design you provided. This update brings a significantly more modern and interactive feel to the authentication process.

## Key Enhancements

### 1. Aceternity UI Components
- **Interactive Inputs**: Created custom [Input](file:///Users/santiagovalencia/proyecto%20informatico_1%20frontend/Proyecto_Informatico/src/components/ui/input.tsx#6-8) and [Label](file:///Users/santiagovalencia/proyecto%20informatico_1%20frontend/Proyecto_Informatico/src/components/ui/label.tsx#5-7) components. The inputs feature a dynamic "follow-me" radial gradient effect that reacts to mouse movement.
- **Premium Shadows**: Configured a specialized `shadow-input` in Tailwind for that distinctive lifted-glass look.

### 2. Social Authentication Integration
- **GitHub & Google**: Added premium-styled social login buttons with the Tabler icons library.
- **Micro-interactions**: Added the [BottomGradient](file:///Users/santiagovalencia/proyecto%20informatico_1%20frontend/Proyecto_Informatico/src/components/auth/AuthCard.tsx#230-238) effect to all primary buttons, which shimmers on hover.

### 3. "Deploy" Aesthetic
- Updated the form headers to "Welcome Back" and "Join DevAuth".
- Used terminal-inspired terminology like "Identity Endpoint" and "Initialize Session".

### 4. Cohesive Sliding Layout
- The new forms are perfectly integrated into the **Sliding Overlay** container.
- The transition between Login and Register remains ultra-smooth while showcasing the new UI.

